{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000750/extras/a43a581808d5e24a1cbd434052a5ac8a.poster.avif?t=1757959831\" width=1170 height=878 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000750/extras/a43a581808d5e24a1cbd434052a5ac8a.webm?t=1757959831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000750/extras/a43a581808d5e24a1cbd434052a5ac8a.mp4?t=1757959831\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the\u00a0<strong>Trash Dungeon\u00a0DEMO</strong>. <br><br><strong>Trash Dungeon</strong> is an action-packed dungeon roguelike where you play as a rabid raccoon stealing trash and treasure in a trash dungeon.<br><br>You are Mike, a raccoon with a ski-mask and a gun - and you have rabies. You must keep killing to stay alive.<br><br> In this <strong>DEMO</strong>, you'll shoot through the Trash Dungeon's first 10 floors in Zone 1, The Cellar. You'll be able to collect and choose between 15 different treasures, and 12 different weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000750/extras/c33b730ffe981a686118f5a9fe16fe42.poster.avif?t=1757959831\" width=826 height=736 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000750/extras/c33b730ffe981a686118f5a9fe16fe42.webm?t=1757959831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000750/extras/c33b730ffe981a686118f5a9fe16fe42.mp4?t=1757959831\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Keep killing enemies and collect trash to rack up your combo. Collect treasures that give you crazy perks, which get stronger the higher your combo gets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, make sure you're collecting enough trash, or the Trash God will smite you before you get to the next level.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4000750?t=1757959831","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4000750?t=1757959831","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000750/141ac6f4fa7a055e408665ea9025108b4cab70bd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757959831","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000750/141ac6f4fa7a055e408665ea9025108b4cab70bd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757959831","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000750/extras/a43a581808d5e24a1cbd434052a5ac8a.poster.avif?t=1757959831\" width=1170 height=878 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000750/extras/a43a581808d5e24a1cbd434052a5ac8a.webm?t=1757959831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000750/extras/a43a581808d5e24a1cbd434052a5ac8a.mp4?t=1757959831\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the\u00a0<strong>Trash Dungeon\u00a0DEMO</strong>. <br><br><strong>Trash Dungeon</strong> is an action-packed dungeon roguelike where you play as a rabid raccoon stealing trash and treasure in a trash dungeon.<br><br>You are Mike, a raccoon with a ski-mask and a gun - and you have rabies. You must keep killing to stay alive.<br><br> In this <strong>DEMO</strong>, you'll shoot through the Trash Dungeon's first 10 floors in Zone 1, The Cellar. You'll be able to collect and choose between 15 different treasures, and 12 different weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000750/extras/c33b730ffe981a686118f5a9fe16fe42.poster.avif?t=1757959831\" width=826 height=736 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000750/extras/c33b730ffe981a686118f5a9fe16fe42.webm?t=1757959831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000750/extras/c33b730ffe981a686118f5a9fe16fe42.mp4?t=1757959831\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Keep killing enemies and collect trash to rack up your combo. Collect treasures that give you crazy perks, which get stronger the higher your combo gets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, make sure you're collecting enough trash, or the Trash God will smite you before you get to the next level.</p>","developers":["vaaasm"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3276690","name":"Trash Dungeon"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000750/d5bfb27fa3bf2b0128e27ec1b5460aef170b0444/header.jpg?t=1757959831","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257192902,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akama